## Implementation Notes for Codex (P1)
- BB2: iBands(NULL,0,50,2,0,PRICE_CLOSE,MODE_LOWER,i)
- BB3: iBands(NULL,0,50,3,0,PRICE_CLOSE,MODE_LOWER,i)
- BB4: iBands(NULL,0,50,4,0,PRICE_CLOSE,MODE_LOWER,i)
- RSI(3): iRSI(NULL,0,3,PRICE_CLOSE,0)
- Stoch(6,3,3): iStochastic(NULL,0,6,3,3,MODE_SMA,0,MODE_MAIN/SIGNAL,0)
- State: ARMED on touch (bar[1] touched band) → ENTRY on retrace-back (bar[0] closes above band + oscillator confirm)
- SL: bb3_lower[0]; if Low[0]<bb3_lower[0] use bb4_lower[0]
- TP: iBands middle (SMA50)
- P3 sweeps: BB period (50 vs 20 vs 100), σ levels (2/3/4 vs 1.5/2/3), lookback (1 vs 2 vs 3 bars)

